    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "```python\nimport sys\nimport math\n\ndef solve():\n    input = sys.stdin.read\n    data = input().split()\n    idx = 0\n    N = int(data[idx])\n    idx += 1\n    D = [int(data[idx + i]) for i in range(N)]\n    idx += N\n    L1 = int(data[idx])\n    C1 = int(data[idx + 1])\n    K1 = int(data[idx + 2])\n    idx += 3\n    L2 = int(data[idx])\n    C2 = int(data[idx + 1])\n    K2 = int(data[idx + 2])\n    \n    INF = float('inf')\n    dp = [INF] * (K1 + 1)\n    dp[0] = 0\n    for d in D:\n        new_dp = [INF] * (K1 + 1)\n        max_a_needed = min(K1, (d + L1 - 1) // L1)\n        for j in range(K1 + 1):\n            if dp[j] == INF:\n                continue\n            b_base = (d + L2 - 1) // L2\n            cum = 0\n            for a in range(max_a_needed + 1):\n                if j + a > K1:\n                    break\n                bb = max(0, (d - a * L1 + L2 - 1) // L2)\n                new_dp[j + a] = min(new_dp[j + a], dp[j] + bb)\n        dp = new_dp\n    min_cost = INF\n    for A in range(K1 + 1):\n        if dp[A] <= K2:\n            cost = A * C1 + dp[A] * C2\n            if cost < min_cost:\n                min_cost = cost\n    if min_cost == INF:\n        print(-1)\n    else:\n        print(min_cost)\n\nsolve()\n```",
