      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef solve():\n    import sys\n    input = sys.stdin.read\n    data = input().split()\n    index = 0\n    t = int(data[index])\n    index += 1\n    results = []\n    for _ in range(t):\n        n = int(data[index])\n        k = int(data[index + 1])\n        index += 2\n        s = data[index]\n        index += 1\n        freq = [0] * 26\n        for c in s:\n            freq[ord(c) - ord('a')] += 1\n        odd = sum(1 for f in freq if f % 2 == 1)\n        L = n - k\n        target = L % 2\n        k_min = abs(odd - target)\n        if k >= k_min and (k - k_min) % 2 == 0:\n            results.append(\"YES\")\n        else:\n            results.append(\"NO\")\n    print(\"\\n\".join(results))\n\nsolve()\n```",
