    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "```python\nimport sys\ndef main():\n  input = sys.stdin.read\n  data = input().split()\n  N = int(data[0])\n  M = int(data[1])\n  INF = 10**30\n  adj = [[] for _ in range(N)]\n  idx = 2\n  for _ in range(M):\n    u = int(data[idx]) - 1\n    v = int(data[idx + 1]) - 1\n    w = int(data[idx + 2])\n    adj[u].append((v, w))\n    idx += 3\n  dp = [[INF] * N for _ in range(1 << N)]\n  for i in range(N):\n    dp[1 << i][i] = 0\n  for mask in range(1 << N):\n    nodes_in = [j for j in range(N) if (mask & (1 << j))]\n    S = len(nodes_in)\n    for _ in range(S):\n      updated = False\n      for u in nodes_in:\n        if dp[mask][u] == INF:\n          continue\n        for v, w in adj[u]:\n          if (mask & (1 << v)) != 0:\n            if dp[mask][v] > dp[mask][u] + w:\n              dp[mask][v] = dp[mask][u] + w\n              updated = True\n      if not updated:\n        break\n    for u in nodes_in:\n      if dp[mask][u] == INF:\n        continue\n      for v, w in adj[u]:\n        if (mask & (1 << v)) == 0:\n          nmask = mask | (1 << v)\n          if dp[nmask][v] > dp[mask][u] + w:\n            dp[nmask][v] = dp[mask][u] + w\n  full = (1 << N) - 1\n  ans = min(dp[full])\n  if ans >= INF // 2:\n    print(\"No\")\n  else:\n    print(ans)\nmain()\n```",
