      "generated_answer": "```python\nimport sys\n\ndef solve():\n    input = sys.stdin.read\n    data = input().split()\n    N = int(data[0])\n    X = int(data[1])\n    T = list(map(int, data[2:2+N]))\n    MOD = 998244353\n    invN = pow(N, MOD-2, MOD)\n    if X == 0:\n        print(invN)\n        return\n    p = [0] * (X + 1)\n    p[0] = 1\n    for t in range(X + 1):\n        if p[t] == 0:\n            continue\n        for i in range(N):\n            nt = t + T[i]\n            if nt <= X:\n                p[nt] = (p[nt] + p[t] * invN) % MOD\n    T1 = T[0]\n    ans = 0\n    start = max(0, X - T1 + 1)\n    for s in range(start, X + 1):\n        ans = (ans + p[s] * invN) % MOD\n    print(ans)\n\nsolve()\n```",
