      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef main():\n    import sys\n    from collections import deque\n    input = sys.stdin.read\n    data = input().split()\n    N = int(data[0])\n    K = int(data[1])\n    A = list(map(int, data[2:]))\n    queue = deque(A)\n    empty = K\n    count = 0\n    while True:\n        if not queue:\n            count += 1\n            break\n        if empty < queue[0]:\n            count += 1\n            empty = K\n        else:\n            empty -= queue.popleft()\n    print(count)\n\nmain()\n```",
