    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "```python\nimport sys\nimport bisect\n\ndef solve():\n    input = sys.stdin.read\n    data = input().split()\n    index = 0\n    N = int(data[index])\n    index += 1\n    A = [int(data[index + i]) for i in range(N)]\n    index += N\n    Q = int(data[index])\n    index += 1\n    prefix = [0] * N\n    for i in range(1, N):\n        if i % 2 == 0:\n            prefix[i] = prefix[i - 1] + (A[i] - A[i - 1])\n        else:\n            prefix[i] = prefix[i - 1]\n    def cum(t):\n        if t <= 0:\n            return 0\n        pos = bisect.bisect_right(A, t) - 1\n        extra = 0\n        if pos % 2 == 1:\n            extra = t - A[pos]\n        return prefix[pos] + extra\n    for q in range(Q):\n        L = int(data[index])\n        R = int(data[index + 1])\n        index += 2\n        print(cum(R) - cum(L))\n\nsolve()\n```",
