      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef solve():\n    import sys\n    input = sys.stdin.read\n    data = input().split()\n    N = int(data[0])\n    names = []\n    ratings = []\n    idx = 1\n    for i in range(N):\n        names.append(data[idx])\n        ratings.append(int(data[idx + 1]))\n        idx += 2\n    total = sum(ratings)\n    sorted_names = sorted(names)\n    winner_idx = total % N\n    print(sorted_names[winner_idx])\n\nsolve()\n```",
