      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef check_extended_abc():\n    S = input().strip()\n    i = 0\n    n = len(S)\n    while i < n and S[i] == 'A':\n        i += 1\n    while i < n and S[i] == 'B':\n        i += 1\n    while i < n and S[i] == 'C':\n        i += 1\n    if i == n:\n        print(\"Yes\")\n    else:\n        print(\"No\")\n\ncheck_extended_abc()\n```",
