      "generated_answer": "```python\nimport sys\n\ndef main():\n    input = sys.stdin.read\n    data = input().split()\n    N = int(data[0])\n    S = data[1]\n    total = 0\n    prev_cnt = 0\n    for j in range(1, N+1):\n        A = int(S[j-1])\n        if A == 0:\n            cnt = j - 1\n        else:\n            cnt = 1 + (j - 1 - prev_cnt)\n        total += cnt\n        prev_cnt = cnt\n    print(total)\n\nmain()\n```",
