      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef min_cost():\n    import sys\n    input = sys.stdin.read\n    data = input().split()\n    N = int(data[0])\n    D = int(data[1])\n    P = int(data[2])\n    F = list(map(int, data[3:]))\n    F.sort(reverse=True)\n    prefix = [0] * (N + 1)\n    for i in range(1, N + 1):\n        prefix[i] = prefix[i - 1] + F[i - 1]\n    total = prefix[N]\n    max_M = (N + D - 1) // D\n    ans = total\n    for M in range(0, max_M + 1):\n        k = min(N, M * D)\n        cost = M * P + total - prefix[k]\n        if cost < ans:\n            ans = cost\n    print(ans)\n\nmin_cost()\n```",
