      "generated_answer": "```python\nimport sys\ninput = sys.stdin.read\ndata = input().split()\nN = int(data[0])\nT = data[1]\nM = len(T)\nS_list = data[2:2+N]\n\ndef check(S):\n    L = len(S)\n    if L == M:\n        diff = sum(1 for a,b in zip(S,T) if a!=b)\n        return diff <= 1\n    elif L == M + 1:\n        # delete one from S to get T\n        i = 0\n        j = 0\n        skipped = False\n        while i < L and j < M:\n            if S[i] == T[j]:\n                i += 1\n                j += 1\n            else:\n                if skipped:\n                    return False\n                skipped = True\n                i += 1\n        if not skipped:\n            i += 1\n        return i == L and j == M\n    elif L == M - 1:\n        # insert one into S to get T\n        i = 0\n        j = 0\n        skipped = False\n        while i < L and j < M:\n            if S[i] == T[j]:\n                i += 1\n                j += 1\n            else:\n                if skipped:\n                    return False\n                skipped = True\n                j += 1\n        if not skipped:\n            j += 1\n        return i == L and j == M\n    return False\n\nresult = []\nfor idx, S in enumerate(S_list, 1):\n    if check(S):\n        result.append(idx)\nprint(len(result))\nif result:\n    print(' '.join(map(str, result)))\n```",
