    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef solve():\n    import sys\n    input = sys.stdin.read\n    data = input().split()\n    M = int(data[0])\n    D = list(map(int, data[1:]))\n    total = sum(D)\n    mid = (total + 1) // 2\n    cum = 0\n    for a in range(M):\n        if cum + D[a] >= mid:\n            b = mid - cum\n            print(a + 1, b)\n            return\n        cum += D[a]\n\nsolve()\n```",
