 6\r\n1 1\r\n1 2\r\n2 1\r\n2 2\r\n3 1\r\n3 2\n\nSample Output 2\n\n0\r\n\nThere may be no holeless square.\n\nSample Input 3\n\n1 1 0\n\nSample Output 3\n\n1\r\n\nThe whole grid may be a holeless square.\n\nSample Input 4\n\n3000 3000 0\n\nSample Output 4\n\n9004500500",
