    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "```python\nimport sys\ndef getMaxFunctionValue(receiver, k):\n    n = len(receiver)\n    LOG = 40\n    jump = [[0] * LOG for _ in range(n)]\n    addsum = [[0] * LOG for _ in range(n)]\n    for i in range(n):\n        jump[i][0] = receiver[i]\n        addsum[i][0] = receiver[i]\n    for j in range(1, LOG):\n        for i in range(n):\n            mid = jump[i][j-1]\n            jump[i][j] = jump[mid][j-1]\n            addsum[i][j] = addsum[i][j-1] + addsum[mid][j-1]\n    max_val = 0\n    for start in range(n):\n        total = start\n        cur = start\n        rem = k\n        for b in range(LOG-1, -1, -1):\n            if (rem & (1 << b)) != 0:\n                total += addsum[cur][b]\n                cur = jump[cur][b]\n        max_val = max(max_val, total)\n    return max_val\n```\nThe code above defines the required function body.",
