      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef medianOfUniquenessArray(nums):\n    n = len(nums)\n    total_subarrays = n * (n + 1) // 2\n    target_idx = (total_subarrays - 1) // 2  # median index (0-based, smaller if even)\n\n    def count_subarrays_with_at_most_k_distinct(k):\n        count = 0\n        left = 0\n        freq = {}\n        for right in range(n):\n            freq[nums[right]] = freq.get(nums[right], 0) + 1\n            while len(freq) > k:\n                freq[nums[left]] -= 1\n                if freq[nums[left]] == 0:\n                    del freq[nums[left]]\n                left += 1\n            count += right - left + 1\n        return count\n\n    left, right = 1, n\n    while left < right:\n        mid = (left + right) // 2\n        if count_subarrays_with_at_most_k_distinct(mid) <= target_idx:\n            left = mid + 1\n        else:\n            right = mid\n    return left\n```",
