    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "```python\nimport sys\nsys.setrecursionlimit(10**6)\n\ndef compute():\n    input = sys.stdin.read\n    data = input().split()\n    N = int(data[0])\n    edges = []\n    idx = 1\n    tree = [[] for _ in range(N+1)]\n    for i in range(N-1):\n        u = int(data[idx])\n        v = int(data[idx+1])\n        idx += 2\n        tree[u].append(v)\n        tree[v].append(u)\n    \n    if len(tree[1]) <= 1:\n        print(1)\n        return\n    \n    def dfs(node, parent):\n        size = 1\n        for nei in tree[node]:\n            if nei != parent:\n                size += dfs(nei, node)\n        return size\n    \n    sizes = []\n    for nei in tree[1]:\n        sz = dfs(nei, 1)\n        sizes.append(sz)\n    \n    sizes.sort()\n    ans = sum(sizes[:len(sizes)-1]) + 1\n    print(ans)\n\ncompute()\n```",
