      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef find_farthest_points():\n    import sys\n    input = sys.stdin.read\n    data = input().split()\n    N = int(data[0])\n    points = []\n    idx = 1\n    for i in range(N):\n        x = int(data[idx])\n        y = int(data[idx + 1])\n        points.append((x, y))\n        idx += 2\n    for i in range(N):\n        max_dist_sq = -1\n        best_j = -1\n        xi, yi = points[i]\n        for j in range(N):\n            if i == j:\n                continue\n            xj, yj = points[j]\n            dx = xi - xj\n            dy = yi - yj\n            dist_sq = dx * dx + dy * dy\n            if dist_sq > max_dist_sq or (dist_sq == max_dist_sq and (best_j == -1 or j < best_j)):\n                max_dist_sq = dist_sq\n                best_j = j\n        print(best_j + 1)\n\nfind_farthest_points()\n```",
