    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef sumOfPower(nums, k):\n    MOD = 10**9 + 7\n    n = len(nums)\n    dp = [[0] * (k + 1) for _ in range(n + 1)]\n    dp[0][0] = 1\n    for num in nums:\n        for sz in range(n - 1, -1, -1):\n            for s in range(k, num - 1, -1):\n                dp[sz + 1][s] = (dp[sz + 1][s] + dp[sz][s - num]) % MOD\n    res = 0\n    p2 = pow(2, n, MOD)\n    inv2 = pow(2, MOD - 2, MOD)\n    for sz in range(1, n + 1):\n        res = (res + dp[sz][k] * p2) % MOD\n        p2 = p2 * inv2 % MOD\n    return res\n```",
