      "generated_answer": "```python\nimport sys\n\ndef solve():\n    input = sys.stdin.read\n    data = input().split()\n    idx = 0\n    N = int(data[idx])\n    idx += 1\n    D = [[0] * N for _ in range(N)]\n    for i in range(N):\n        for j in range(i + 1, N):\n            D[i][j] = D[j][i] = int(data[idx])\n            idx += 1\n    INF = float('-inf')\n    dp = [INF] * (1 << N)\n    dp[0] = 0\n    for mask in range(1 << N):\n        if dp[mask] == INF:\n            continue\n        for i in range(N):\n            if (mask & (1 << i)) != 0:\n                continue\n            for j in range(i + 1, N):\n                if (mask & (1 << j)) != 0:\n                    continue\n                new_mask = mask | (1 << i) | (1 << j)\n                dp[new_mask] = max(dp[new_mask], dp[mask] + D[i][j])\n    ans = max(dp)\n    print(ans)\n\nsolve()\n```",
