put 2\n\n1 2\r\n\nInitially, cookies were placed on the squares inside the rectangle with (1, 1) as the top-left corner and (3, 2) as the bottom-right corner, and Snuke ate the cookie at (1, 2).\n\nSample Input 3\n\n6 6\r\n..####\r\n..##.#\r\n..####\r\n..####\r\n..####\r\n......\n\nSample Output 3\n\n2 5",
