      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef countStableArrays(zero: int, one: int, limit: int) -> int:\n    MOD = 10**9 + 7\n    dp = {}\n    \n    def dfs(remain_zero, remain_one, last_run_val, last_run_len):\n        key = (remain_zero, remain_one, last_run_val, last_run_len)\n        if key in dp:\n            return dp[key]\n        \n        if remain_zero == 0 and remain_one == 0:\n            return 1\n        \n        total = 0\n        \n        # Try adding 0\n        if remain_zero > 0:\n            if last_run_val == 0 and last_run_len < limit:\n                total += dfs(remain_zero - 1, remain_one, 0, last_run_len + 1)\n            elif last_run_val != 0:\n                total += dfs(remain_zero - 1, remain_one, 0, 1)\n        \n        # Try adding 1\n        if remain_one > 0:\n            if last_run_val == 1 and last_run_len < limit:\n                total += dfs(remain_zero, remain_one - 1, 1, last_run_len + 1)\n            elif last_run_val != 1:\n                total += dfs(remain_zero, remain_one - 1, 1, 1)\n        \n        dp[key] = total % MOD\n        return dp[key]\n    \n    return dfs(zero, one, -1, 0)\n```",
