are five cells painted with color 0, four with color 2, and three with color 5.\n\nSample Input 2\n\n1 1 5\n1 1 1\n1 1 10\n2 1 100\n1 1 1000\n2 1 10000\n\nSample Output 2\n\n1\n10000 1\n\nSample Input 3\n\n5 5 10\n1 1 1\n1 2 2\n1 3 3\n1 4 4\n1 5 5\n2 1 6\n2 2 7\n2 3 8\n2 4 9\n2 5 10\n\nSample Output 3\n\n5\n6 5\n7 5\n8 5\n9 5\n10 5",
