      "generated_answer": "```python\nimport sys\nimport bisect\nfrom collections import defaultdict\n\ndef main():\n    input = sys.stdin.read\n    data = input().split()\n    index = 0\n    H = int(data[index])\n    index += 1\n    W = int(data[index])\n    index += 1\n    M = int(data[index])\n    index += 1\n    operations = []\n    for _ in range(M):\n        T = int(data[index])\n        index += 1\n        A = int(data[index])\n        index += 1\n        X = int(data[index])\n        index += 1\n        operations.append((T, A, X))\n    row_time = [0] * (H + 1)\n    row_color = [0] * (H + 1)\n    col_time = [0] * (W + 1)\n    col_color = [0] * (W + 1)\n    for t in range(1, M + 1):\n        T, A, X = operations[t - 1]\n        if T == 1:\n            row_time[A] = t\n            row_color[A] = X\n        else:\n            col_time[A] = t\n            col_color[A] = X\n    counts = defaultdict(int)\n    col_time_sorted = sorted(col_time[1:])\n    for r in range(1, H + 1):\n        rt = row_time[r]\n        if rt > 0:\n            num = bisect.bisect_left(col_time_sorted, rt)\n            counts[row_color[r]] += num\n    row_time_sorted = sorted(row_time[1:])\n    for c in range(1, W + 1):\n        ct = col_time[c]\n        if ct > 0:\n            num = bisect.bisect_left(row_time_sorted, ct)\n            counts[col_color[c]] += num\n    unpainted_rows = sum(1 for rt in row_time[1:] if rt == 0)\n    unpainted_cols = sum(1 for ct in col_time[1:] if ct == 0)\n    color0_count = unpainted_rows * unpainted_cols\n    if color0_count > 0:\n        counts[0] = color0_count\n    result = []\n    for color in sorted(counts.keys()):\n        if counts[color] > 0:\n            result.append((color, counts[color]))\n    print(len(result))\n    for c, x in result:\n        print(c, x)\n\nmain()\n```",
