      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef func():\n    import sys\n    from collections import defaultdict\n    input = sys.stdin.read\n    data = input().split()\n    index = 0\n    N = int(data[index])\n    index += 1\n    K = int(data[index])\n    index += 1\n    P = int(data[index])\n    index += 1\n    plans = []\n    for _ in range(N):\n        C = int(data[index])\n        index += 1\n        A = [int(data[index + j]) for j in range(K)]\n        index += K\n        plans.append((C, A))\n    INF = float('inf')\n    dp = defaultdict(lambda: INF)\n    dp[tuple([0] * K)] = 0\n    for C, A in plans:\n        new_dp = dp.copy()\n        for state, cost in list(dp.items()):\n            new_state_list = [min(P, state[j] + A[j]) for j in range(K)]\n            new_state = tuple(new_state_list)\n            new_cost = cost + C\n            if new_cost < new_dp[new_state]:\n                new_dp[new_state] = new_cost\n        dp = new_dp\n    target = tuple([P] * K)\n    ans = dp[target]\n    print(ans if ans < INF else -1)\nfunc()\n```",
