      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef longest_common_prefix(arr1, arr2):\n    # Convert numbers to strings for easier prefix comparison\n    str_arr1 = list(map(str, arr1))\n    str_arr2 = list(map(str, arr2))\n    \n    # Generate all possible prefixes for arr1 numbers and store in a set\n    prefixes = set()\n    for num_str in str_arr1:\n        for i in range(1, len(num_str) + 1):\n            prefixes.add(num_str[:i])\n    \n    # Check each number in arr2 for longest prefix match\n    max_len = 0\n    for num_str in str_arr2:\n        for i in range(1, len(num_str) + 1):\n            if num_str[:i] in prefixes:\n                max_len = max(max_len, i)\n    \n    return max_len\n```",
