    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef minimum_possible_sum(n: int, k: int) -> int:\n    used = set()\n    result = []\n    current = 1\n    \n    while len(result) < n:\n        if current not in used and (k - current) not in used:\n            result.append(current)\n            used.add(current)\n            used.add(k - current)\n        current += 1\n    \n    return sum(result)\n```",
