      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef main():\n    import sys\n    input = sys.stdin.read\n    data = input().split()\n    N = int(data[0])\n    cards = []\n    for i in range(N):\n        A = int(data[2*i+1])\n        C = int(data[2*i+2])\n        cards.append((A, C, i+1))\n    cards.sort(key=lambda x: -x[0])\n    remaining = []\n    min_c = float('inf')\n    for card in cards:\n        if card[1] < min_c:\n            remaining.append(card[2])\n            min_c = card[1]\n    remaining.sort()\n    print(len(remaining))\n    print(' '.join(map(str, remaining)))\n\nmain()\n```",
