      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef check_chord_intersections():\n    import sys\n    input = sys.stdin.read\n    data = input().split()\n    N = int(data[0])\n    intervals = []\n    index = 1\n    for _ in range(N):\n        A = int(data[index])\n        B = int(data[index + 1])\n        index += 2\n        L = min(A, B)\n        R = max(A, B)\n        intervals.append((L, R))\n    intervals.sort()\n    maxR = 0\n    for L, R in intervals:\n        if L < maxR and R > maxR:\n            print(\"Yes\")\n            return\n        if R > maxR:\n            maxR = R\n    print(\"No\")\n\ncheck_chord_intersections()\n```",
