    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef compute_union_area():\n    import sys\n    input = sys.stdin.read\n    data = input().split()\n    N = int(data[0])\n    rects = []\n    idx = 1\n    for _ in range(N):\n        A = int(data[idx])\n        B = int(data[idx+1])\n        C = int(data[idx+2])\n        D = int(data[idx+3])\n        rects.append((A, B, C, D))\n        idx += 4\n    covered = [[False] * 100 for _ in range(100)]\n    for A, B, C, D in rects:\n        for x in range(A, B):\n            for y in range(C, D):\n                covered[x][y] = True\n    area = sum(sum(row) for row in covered)\n    print(area)\n\ncompute_union_area()\n```",
