      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef coloredCells(n, queries):\n    nums = [0] * n\n    answer = []\n    count = 0\n    \n    for index, color in queries:\n        old_color = nums[index]\n        nums[index] = color\n        \n        # Check left neighbor\n        if index > 0 and nums[index-1] != 0 and nums[index-1] == color:\n            count += 1\n        if index > 0 and nums[index-1] != 0 and nums[index-1] == old_color and old_color != color:\n            count -= 1\n        \n        # Check right neighbor\n        if index < n-1 and nums[index+1] != 0 and nums[index+1] == color:\n            count += 1\n        if index < n-1 and nums[index+1] != 0 and nums[index+1] == old_color and old_color != color:\n            count -= 1\n            \n        answer.append(count)\n    \n    return answer\n```",
