      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef distinct_difference_array(nums):\n    n = len(nums)\n    diff = [0] * n\n    suffix_counts = {}\n    \n    for num in nums:\n        suffix_counts[num] = suffix_counts.get(num, 0) + 1\n    \n    prefix_set = set()\n    for i in range(n):\n        prefix_set.add(nums[i])\n        suffix_counts[nums[i]] -= 1\n        if suffix_counts[nums[i]] == 0:\n            del suffix_counts[nums[i]]\n        diff[i] = len(prefix_set) - len(suffix_counts)\n    \n    return diff\n```",
