      "generated_answer": "```python\nimport sys\nfrom functools import cmp_to_key\n\ndef solve():\n    input = sys.stdin.read\n    data = input().split()\n    N = int(data[0])\n    people = []\n    idx = 1\n    for i in range(1, N+1):\n        A = int(data[idx])\n        B = int(data[idx+1])\n        idx += 2\n        people.append((i, A, B))\n    def cmp(a, b):\n        A1, B1 = a[1], a[2]\n        A2, B2 = b[1], b[2]\n        cross1 = A1 * (A2 + B2)\n        cross2 = A2 * (A1 + B1)\n        if cross1 != cross2:\n            return -1 if cross1 > cross2 else 1\n        else:\n            if a[0] != b[0]:\n                return -1 if a[0] < b[0] else 1\n            return 0\n    people.sort(key=cmp_to_key(cmp))\n    print(' '.join(str(p[0]) for p in people))\n\nsolve()\n```",
