      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef max_pairs(words):\n    count = 0\n    used = set()\n    \n    for i, word in enumerate(words):\n        if i in used:\n            continue\n        reversed_word = word[::-1]\n        \n        # Look for matching reversed word at indices > i\n        for j in range(i + 1, len(words)):\n            if j in used:\n                continue\n            if words[j] == reversed_word:\n                count += 1\n                used.add(i)\n                used.add(j)\n                break\n    \n    return count\n```",
