      "generated_answer": "```python\nfrom typing import List\nimport sys\ndef minimumMoves(nums: List[int], k: int, maxChanges: int) -> int:\n    pos = [i for i in range(len(nums)) if nums[i] == 1]\n    p = len(pos)\n    if p == 0:\n        return 2 * k\n    prefix = [0] * (p + 1)\n    for i in range(1, p + 1):\n        prefix[i] = prefix[i - 1] + pos[i - 1]\n    def get_cost(left: int, right: int) -> int:\n        m = right - left + 1\n        med = left + (m - 1) // 2\n        med_val = pos[med]\n        left_cost = med_val * (med - left) - (prefix[med] - prefix[left])\n        right_cost = (prefix[right + 1] - prefix[med + 1]) - med_val * (right - med)\n        return left_cost + right_cost\n    lo = max(0, k - maxChanges)\n    hi = min(k, p)\n    ans = sys.maxsize\n    for m in range(lo, hi + 1):\n        for i in range(p - m + 1):\n            ans = min(ans, get_cost(i, i + m - 1) + 2 * (k - m))\n    return ans\n```",
