      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef maxFrequencyScore(nums, k):\n    nums.sort()\n    n = len(nums)\n    prefix = [0] * (n + 1)\n    for i in range(n):\n        prefix[i + 1] = prefix[i] + nums[i]\n    \n    def cost(l, r):\n        mid = (l + r) // 2\n        median = nums[mid]\n        left_cost = median * (mid - l + 1) - (prefix[mid + 1] - prefix[l])\n        right_cost = (prefix[r + 1] - prefix[mid + 1]) - median * (r - mid)\n        return left_cost + right_cost\n    \n    res = 0\n    left = 0\n    for right in range(n):\n        while cost(left, right) > k:\n            left += 1\n        res = max(res, right - left + 1)\n    return res\n```",
