      "generated_answer": "```python\nfrom collections import defaultdict\n\ndef min_size_subarray(nums, target):\n    n = len(nums)\n    total = sum(nums)\n    \n    # If target is larger than total, reduce it using full cycles\n    if total > 0:\n        cycles = (target - 1) // total\n        target %= total\n        if target == 0:\n            return cycles * n\n    \n    # Extend nums to handle wrap-around (at most 2 copies needed)\n    arr = nums + nums\n    prefix_sum = 0\n    prefix_map = {0: -1}\n    min_len = float('inf')\n    \n    for i, num in enumerate(arr):\n        prefix_sum += num\n        needed = prefix_sum - target\n        if needed in prefix_map:\n            min_len = min(min_len, i - prefix_map[needed])\n        prefix_map[prefix_sum] = i\n        \n        # Early exit if we found optimal (length <= n)\n        if min_len <= n:\n            break\n    \n    return min_len if min_len != float('inf') else -1\n```",
