      "generated_answer": "```python\nimport sys\n\ndef solve():\n    input = sys.stdin.read\n    data = input().split()\n    N = int(data[0])\n    Q = [int(x) for x in data[1:1+N]]\n    A = [int(x) for x in data[1+N:1+2*N]]\n    B = [int(x) for x in data[1+2*N:1+3*N]]\n    ans = 0\n    maxx = 0\n    for i in range(N):\n        if A[i] > 0:\n            maxx = max(maxx, Q[i] // A[i])\n    maxx += 1\n    for x in range(maxx + 1):\n        rem = []\n        feasible = True\n        for i in range(N):\n            used = x * A[i]\n            if used > Q[i]:\n                feasible = False\n                break\n            rem.append(Q[i] - used)\n        if not feasible:\n            continue\n        maxy = 10**9\n        for i in range(N):\n            if B[i] > 0:\n                maxy = min(maxy, rem[i] // B[i])\n        ans = max(ans, x + maxy)\n    print(ans)\n\nsolve()\n```",
