    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "```python\nimport sys\ninput = sys.stdin.read\n\ndef main():\n    data = input().split()\n    index = 0\n    N = int(data[index])\n    index += 1\n    Q = int(data[index])\n    index += 1\n    C = [0] + [int(data[index + i]) for i in range(N)]\n    index += N\n    box_sets = [set() for _ in range(N + 1)]\n    for i in range(1, N + 1):\n        box_sets[i].add(C[i])\n    queries = []\n    for _ in range(Q):\n        a = int(data[index])\n        index += 1\n        b = int(data[index])\n        index += 1\n        queries.append((a, b))\n    for a, b in queries:\n        sa = box_sets[a]\n        sb = box_sets[b]\n        if len(sa) > len(sb):\n            for c in sb:\n                sa.add(c)\n            box_sets[b] = sa\n            box_sets[a] = set()\n        else:\n            for c in sa:\n                sb.add(c)\n            box_sets[a] = set()\n        print(len(box_sets[b]))\n\nmain()\n```",
