    "prediction": "Qwen/Qwen3-Coder-Next",
    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef can_split_array(nums, m):\n    n = len(nums)\n    if n <= 1:\n        return True\n    \n    # Precompute prefix sums\n    prefix = [0] * (n + 1)\n    for i in range(n):\n        prefix[i + 1] = prefix[i] + nums[i]\n    \n    def get_sum(i, j):\n        return prefix[j + 1] - prefix[i]\n    \n    # Check all possible splits recursively with memoization\n    from functools import lru_cache\n    \n    @lru_cache(maxsize=None)\n    def dfs(i, j):\n        if i == j:\n            return True\n        \n        total = get_sum(i, j)\n        \n        # Try all possible split positions\n        for k in range(i, j):\n            left_sum = get_sum(i, k)\n            right_sum = get_sum(k + 1, j)\n            \n            left_valid = (k - i + 1 == 1) or left_sum >= m\n            right_valid = (j - k == 1) or right_sum >= m\n            \n            if left_valid and right_valid:\n                if dfs(i, k) and dfs(k + 1, j):\n                    return True\n        \n        return False\n    \n    return dfs(0, n - 1)\n```",
