      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef solve():\n    import sys\n    input = sys.stdin.read\n    data = input().split()\n    N = int(data[0])\n    K = int(data[1])\n    P = [int(x) for x in data[2:]]\n    pos = [0] * (N + 1)\n    for i in range(N):\n        pos[P[i]] = i\n    if K == 1:\n        print(0)\n        return\n    from collections import deque\n    min_dq = deque()\n    max_dq = deque()\n    min_val = float('inf')\n    for i in range(1, N + 1):\n        while min_dq and pos[min_dq[-1]] >= pos[i]:\n            min_dq.pop()\n        min_dq.append(i)\n        while max_dq and pos[max_dq[-1]] <= pos[i]:\n            max_dq.pop()\n        max_dq.append(i)\n        if i >= K:\n            while min_dq[0] < i - K + 1:\n                min_dq.popleft()\n            while max_dq[0] < i - K + 1:\n                max_dq.popleft()\n            current = pos[max_dq[0]] - pos[min_dq[0]]\n            if current < min_val:\n                min_val = current\n    print(min_val)\n\nsolve()\n```",
