      "generated_answer": "```python\nimport sys\nimport heapq\n\ndef main():\n    input = sys.stdin.read\n    data = input().split()\n    N = int(data[0])\n    A = [0] * (N)\n    B = [0] * (N)\n    X = [0] * (N)\n    idx = 1\n    for i in range(1, N):\n        A[i] = int(data[idx])\n        B[i] = int(data[idx+1])\n        X[i] = int(data[idx+2])\n        idx += 3\n    INF = float('inf')\n    dist = [INF] * (N+1)\n    dist[1] = 0\n    pq = [(0, 1)]\n    while pq:\n        cost, u = heapq.heappop(pq)\n        if cost > dist[u]:\n            continue\n        if u < N:\n            v = u + 1\n            nc = cost + A[u]\n            if nc < dist[v]:\n                dist[v] = nc\n                heapq.heappush(pq, (nc, v))\n        v = X[u]\n        nc = cost + B[u]\n        if nc < dist[v]:\n            dist[v] = nc\n            heapq.heappush(pq, (nc, v))\n    print(dist[N])\n\nmain()\n```",
