      "generated_answer": "```python\nimport sys\nimport bisect\n\ndef solve():\n    input = sys.stdin.read\n    data = input().split()\n    N = int(data[0])\n    M = int(data[1])\n    A = list(map(int, data[2:2+N]))\n    B = list(map(int, data[2+N:2+N+M]))\n    A.sort()\n    B.sort()\n    \n    def check(X):\n        sellers = bisect.bisect_right(A, X)\n        buyers = M - bisect.bisect_left(B, X)\n        return sellers >= buyers\n    \n    low = 1\n    high = 10**9 + 1\n    ans = high\n    while low <= high:\n        mid = (low + high) // 2\n        if check(mid):\n            ans = mid\n            high = mid - 1\n        else:\n            low = mid + 1\n    print(ans)\n\nsolve()\n```",
