      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef determine_winner():\n    N = int(input())\n    S = input().strip()\n    count_T = S.count('T')\n    count_A = S.count('A')\n    if count_T > count_A:\n        print('T')\n    elif count_A > count_T:\n        print('A')\n    else:\n        t = 0\n        a = 0\n        M = count_T\n        for c in S:\n            if c == 'T':\n                t += 1\n            else:\n                a += 1\n            if t == M:\n                print('T')\n                return\n            if a == M:\n                print('A')\n                return\n\ndetermine_winner()\n```",
