      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef maxPartitionsAfterOperations(s: str, k: int) -> int:\n    n = len(s)\n    def count_parts(t):\n        parts = 0\n        i = 0\n        while i < n:\n            seen = set()\n            j = i\n            while j < n:\n                seen.add(t[j])\n                if len(seen) > k:\n                    break\n                j += 1\n            parts += 1\n            i = j\n        return parts\n    ans = count_parts(s)\n    for pos in range(n):\n        orig = s[pos]\n        for c in 'abcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyz':\n            if c == orig:\n                continue\n            t = s[:pos] + c + s[pos+1:]\n            ans = max(ans, count_parts(t))\n    return ans\n```",
