      "generated_answer": "```python\nimport sys\n\ndef main():\n    MOD = 998244353\n    input = sys.stdin.read\n    data = input().split()\n    N = int(data[0])\n    M = int(data[1])\n    if M == 0:\n        print(0)\n        return\n    A = M - 1\n    pow1 = pow(A, N, MOD)\n    sign = 1 if N % 2 == 0 else MOD - 1\n    pow2 = (sign * (A % MOD)) % MOD\n    ans = (pow1 + pow2) % MOD\n    print(ans)\n\nmain()\n```",
