s.length <= 10^5 \n1 <= nums[i] <= 10^9\n1 <= modulo <= 10^9\n0 <= k < modulo",
    "prediction": "grok-4-1-fast-reasoning",
    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "```python\nfrom collections import defaultdict\n\ndef countInterestingSubarrays(nums, modulo, k):\n    m = modulo\n    count = defaultdict(int)\n    count[0] = 1\n    prefix = 0\n    ans = 0\n    for num in nums:\n        if m != 0 and num % m == k:\n            prefix += 1\n        target = (prefix - k) % m\n        ans += count[target]\n        count[prefix % m] += 1\n    return ans\n```",
