      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef min_cost(nums, x):\n    n = len(nums)\n    ans = float('inf')\n    # Try all possible number of rotations (0 to n-1)\n    for k in range(n):\n        cost = k * x  # cost of k operations\n        # For each type, pick the minimum cost among all rotations up to k\n        for i in range(n):\n            min_val = float('inf')\n            for j in range(k + 1):\n                idx = (i - j) % n  # index after j rotations\n                if nums[idx] < min_val:\n                    min_val = nums[idx]\n            cost += min_val\n        ans = min(ans, cost)\n    return ans\n```",
