      "generated_answer": "The cache is initially empty, and only reads from B and reads/writes to A occur. Since A blocks become dirty but are never evicted during the loop (each index's A block is accessed last and remains in cache), no dirty block evictions happen. Thus, no bytes are written to memory.\n\n\\boxed{J}",
