    "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: tough and tricky questions : combinations . 8 contestants representing 4 different countries advance to the finals of a fencing championship . assuming all competitors have an equal chance of winning , how many possibilities are there with respect to how a first - place and second - place medal can be awarded ?\n\nOptions: \nA. 6\nB. 7\nC. 12\nD. 16\nE. 24\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
