      "generated_answer": "The expected value is computed as \\(E(X) = 0 \\cdot \\frac{8}{27} + 1 \\cdot \\frac{12}{27} + 2 \\cdot \\frac{6}{27} + 3 \\cdot \\frac{1}{27} = \\frac{27}{27} = 1\\). The second moment is \\(E(X^2) = 0^2 \\cdot \\frac{8}{27} + 1^2 \\cdot \\frac{12}{27} + 2^2 \\cdot \\frac{6}{27} + 3^2 \\cdot \\frac{1}{27} = \\frac{45}{27} = \\frac{5}{3}\\). Thus, the variance is \\(\\text{Var}(X) = E(X^2) - [E(X)]^2 = \\frac{5}{3} - 1 = \\frac{2}{3}\\). This matches option D.\n\n\\boxed{D}",
